/P 61 0 R
/E (stations\(station_id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, station_name TEXT UNIQUE, temperature_unit TEXT\) and readings\(station_id INTEGER, reading_time TEXT, pm25 REAL, pm10 REAL, no2 REAL, temperature_c REAL, PRIMARY KEY\(station_id,reading_time\), FOREIGN KEY station_id REFERENCES stations\). Map CSV station names to station_id and convert timestamps to ISO format. Index \(station_id, reading_time\).)
