82 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 61 0 R
/E (For average PM2.5 at one station in October, CSV requires scanning and filtering the files; SQL uses WHERE plus AVG and an index. For highest hourly PM2.5, SQL uses ORDER BY/DESC LIMIT; for monthly station comparisons, GROUP BY is concise. CSV is portable for exchange; SQL is better for repeated queries and integrity.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
