84 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 61 0 R
/E (Loading a DataFrame for every question incurs an O\(n\) scan and O\(n\) memory. A suitable database index narrows the search and can approach O\(log n + matches\), with persistent disk storage and query execution in SQLite.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
