/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 62 0 R
/E (Dates use ISO 8601 YYYY-MM-DD or full timestamp; station names are trimmed and canonicalised; numbers are finite decimal values with consistent units. Dropping missing values reduces sample size and may bias daily means if failures are systematic. Dropping and forward fill are O\(n\); computing a median by sorting is O\(n log n\), with O\(n\) storage if values are materialised.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
