/Title (At 100 additional stations reporting every 15 minutes, store raw readings in SQLite or a managed relational/time-series database, validate and standardise units at ingestion, retain rejected records, and aggregate by station/day/hour. A lexicon baseline can triage complaints but 50,000/month warrants labelled evaluation and likely a trained classifier if accuracy is insufficient.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 574 0 R
