/Title (Tokenise complaint text, count positive and negative lexicon matches, and invert the next sentiment word when preceded by a negator such as not or never. Positive score means positive sentiment; negative score means negative; zero means neutral. Negation scope is simplistic and sarcasm, intensifiers and mixed clauses can be misclassified.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 723 0 R
>>
endobj
